<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.588 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.588 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (BLN DLRS)		April 19   April 12  April 18, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			     1.588	1.553     2.282</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	     0.600	0.555     1.285</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan	0.310	0.320     0.286</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion	0.676	0.676     0.699</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights	0.002	0.002     0.012</p>
<p>(Central bank has adopted Saturday instead of Thursday for calculating weekly figures after the government changed weekly holiday to Sunday from Friday) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
